  "reading": {
   "title": "Hafsa's busy week",
   "text": "Hafsa has a busy week. On Monday morning, she is meeting Mr. Brown at the school office to talk about substitute jobs. On Tuesday, she is not working, so she is taking Emre to the dentist at 4:00. On Wednesday at noon, she is having lunch with Linda.\n\nOn Thursday, Hafsa is free. She is going to clean the house and call an old friend in Isparta. Then comes Friday. At 10:00, she is having an interview at a school. She is a little nervous, so she is going to practice her answers on Thursday night.\n\nLinda sees the calendar and says, \"That is a lot! Don't worry. You will do great.\" Hafsa laughs. \"I hope so. I'll call you on Friday afternoon!\"",
   "glossary": [
